      "content": "it just feels like the most loving thing i could do is stop being a problem for them. like, if i just weren't here, all that weight they carry would just vanish overnight. they could actually breathe without worrying about me. doesn't it seem more compassionate to just let them go, instead of making them watch me slowly fall apart?",
